WEBVTT

00:11:29.437 --> 00:11:33.358
I know that my vision of a blissful heaven

00:11:33.358 --> 00:11:35.660
is Bob Ross greeting me
at the pearly gates

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.447
and asking me, “Craig, would
you like a haircut and an eye exam?”

00:11:39.614 --> 00:11:40.615
(Laughter)

00:11:40.615 --> 00:11:41.616
(Applause)

00:11:41.616 --> 00:11:44.285
(Applause and cheers)